1
00:00:00,260 --> 00:00:02,471
For one year, I took five grams

2
00:00:02,471 --> 00:00:04,497
of creatine every single day.

3
00:00:04,597 --> 00:00:06,297
Three hundred sixty-five scoops.

4
00:00:06,418 --> 00:00:07,507
Everyone warned me.

5
00:00:07,607 --> 00:00:08,597
You'll get fat.

6
00:00:08,597 --> 00:00:09,471
You'll bloat.

7
00:00:09,471 --> 00:00:10,676
You'll wreck your kidneys.

8
00:00:10,713 --> 00:00:12,055
And you'll lose your hair.

9
00:00:12,176 --> 00:00:13,486
So I tracked everything.

10
00:00:13,586 --> 00:00:15,186
My weight, my strength,

11
00:00:15,186 --> 00:00:16,402
my blood tests.

12
00:00:16,502 --> 00:00:18,118
And yes, my hair.

13
00:00:18,239 --> 00:00:20,160
You don't have any hair.

14
00:00:20,281 --> 00:00:21,723
That's why I was the perfect test

15
00:00:21,723 --> 00:00:22,507
subject.

16
00:00:22,607 --> 00:00:24,013
Stay till the end for that one.

17
00:00:26,239 --> 00:00:28,023
First, what is creatine?

18
00:00:28,123 --> 00:00:29,297
It's not a steroid.

19
00:00:29,397 --> 00:00:31,702
It's a compound your body already makes,

20
00:00:31,702 --> 00:00:33,518
and it's in red meat and fish.

21
00:00:33,639 --> 00:00:35,313
Your muscles use it to recharge their

22
00:00:35,313 --> 00:00:37,623
energy for short, hard efforts.

23
00:00:37,723 --> 00:00:39,102
Think of it as a tiny battery

24
00:00:39,102 --> 00:00:40,434
for every heavy rep.

25
00:00:40,555 --> 00:00:42,513
Most people only have their batteries about

26
00:00:42,513 --> 00:00:43,623
two-thirds full.

27
00:00:43,723 --> 00:00:45,886
Five grams a day tops them up.

28
00:00:45,986 --> 00:00:46,844
That's it.

29
00:00:49,071 --> 00:00:49,981
Month one.

30
00:00:50,081 --> 00:00:51,134
I stepped on the scale and I

31
00:00:51,134 --> 00:00:53,034
was one and a half kilos heavier.

32
00:00:53,155 --> 00:00:55,560
My first thought: it's making me fat.

33
00:00:55,660 --> 00:00:56,592
It wasn't.

34
00:00:56,713 --> 00:00:59,302
Creatine pulls water into your muscle cells,

35
00:00:59,302 --> 00:01:00,571
not under your skin.

36
00:01:00,671 --> 00:01:02,049
So the muscle looks fuller,

37
00:01:02,049 --> 00:01:02,971
not puffy.

38
00:01:03,092 --> 00:01:04,444
And no bloated belly.

39
00:01:04,544 --> 00:01:06,813
That only happens with huge loading doses.

40
00:01:06,913 --> 00:01:09,013
I just took five grams with breakfast.

41
00:01:11,239 --> 00:01:13,265
Month three, the gym changed.

42
00:01:13,365 --> 00:01:14,234
Not a lot.

43
00:01:14,334 --> 00:01:15,555
But every set, I got one or

44
00:01:15,555 --> 00:01:16,781
two extra reps.

45
00:01:16,902 --> 00:01:19,297
Those extra reps add up.

46
00:01:19,397 --> 00:01:21,565
More reps every week means more work,

47
00:01:21,565 --> 00:01:23,355
and more work means more muscle over

48
00:01:23,355 --> 00:01:24,023
time.

49
00:01:24,144 --> 00:01:26,960
So creatine doesn't build muscle by itself?

50
00:01:27,081 --> 00:01:27,718
No.

51
00:01:27,818 --> 00:01:29,434
It lets you train a little harder.

52
00:01:29,534 --> 00:01:30,439
You still have to show up and

53
00:01:30,439 --> 00:01:31,286
do the work.

54
00:01:34,302 --> 00:01:35,549
Month six.

55
00:01:35,649 --> 00:01:37,486
Time to check the scary one.

56
00:01:37,586 --> 00:01:38,549
My kidneys.

57
00:01:38,671 --> 00:01:40,997
My creatinine came back a bit high,

58
00:01:40,997 --> 00:01:43,044
and for one second I panicked.

59
00:01:43,165 --> 00:01:44,802
Then my doctor explained it.

60
00:01:44,902 --> 00:01:47,007
Creatinine is just the waste product of

61
00:01:47,007 --> 00:01:47,907
creatine.

62
00:01:48,007 --> 00:01:49,755
Take more creatine, you make more of

63
00:01:49,755 --> 00:01:50,328
it.

64
00:01:50,428 --> 00:01:52,571
It doesn't mean your kidneys are damaged.

65
00:01:52,692 --> 00:01:55,165
In healthy people, studies over years show

66
00:01:55,165 --> 00:01:57,392
no kidney damage at normal doses.

67
00:01:57,492 --> 00:01:59,660
If you already have kidney problems,

68
00:01:59,660 --> 00:02:01,171
talk to your doctor first.

69
00:02:03,397 --> 00:02:04,602
One full year.

70
00:02:04,702 --> 00:02:06,413
Here's everything that changed.

71
00:02:06,534 --> 00:02:08,460
My weight went up two kilos and

72
00:02:08,460 --> 00:02:09,892
most of it stayed as muscle and

73
00:02:09,892 --> 00:02:11,076
water in the muscle.

74
00:02:11,197 --> 00:02:12,439
My bench press went up more than

75
00:02:12,439 --> 00:02:14,260
my friend's, and we trained together,

76
00:02:14,260 --> 00:02:15,160
same plan.

77
00:02:15,281 --> 00:02:17,518
My energy in long sets was better.

78
00:02:17,618 --> 00:02:18,734
And on low-sleep days,

79
00:02:18,734 --> 00:02:20,360
my head felt a bit sharper.

80
00:02:20,460 --> 00:02:21,723
There's early research on that,

81
00:02:21,723 --> 00:02:22,286
too.

82
00:02:22,407 --> 00:02:23,676
What didn't change?

83
00:02:23,776 --> 00:02:24,997
No fat gain.

84
00:02:24,997 --> 00:02:25,886
No bloat.

85
00:02:25,986 --> 00:02:27,339
No stomach problems.

86
00:02:27,439 --> 00:02:29,507
And I never needed a loading phase.

87
00:02:31,734 --> 00:02:32,760
Now, the hair.

88
00:02:32,860 --> 00:02:34,913
This myth comes from one small study

89
00:02:34,913 --> 00:02:37,249
in rugby players, where one hormone went

90
00:02:37,249 --> 00:02:37,823
up.

91
00:02:37,944 --> 00:02:40,007
Nobody actually measured hair loss in that

92
00:02:40,007 --> 00:02:41,944
study, and newer studies haven't found the

93
00:02:41,944 --> 00:02:43,118
same effect.

94
00:02:43,239 --> 00:02:45,502
So creatine is very unlikely to make

95
00:02:45,502 --> 00:02:46,602
you lose your hair.

96
00:02:46,723 --> 00:02:48,102
As for me, I'll let you be

97
00:02:48,102 --> 00:02:48,855
the judge.

98
00:02:51,081 --> 00:02:52,071
If you want to try it,

99
00:02:52,071 --> 00:02:53,034
it's simple.

100
00:02:53,092 --> 00:02:54,992
Plain creatine monohydrate.

101
00:02:55,092 --> 00:02:56,471
Three to five grams a day,

102
00:02:56,471 --> 00:02:58,013
every day, any time.

103
00:02:58,134 --> 00:02:59,313
Mix it in water,

104
00:02:59,313 --> 00:03:00,876
juice or your coffee.

105
00:03:00,976 --> 00:03:03,271
No fancy versions, no loading,

106
00:03:03,271 --> 00:03:04,255
no cycling.

107
00:03:04,376 --> 00:03:05,560
And drink enough water.

108
00:03:06,313 --> 00:03:07,528
Have you tried creatine?

109
00:03:07,628 --> 00:03:08,934
Tell me what happened in the comments.
